      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Darius winds up and swings his axe in a wide circle. Enemies struck by the blade take more damage than those struck by the handle. Darius heals based on enemy champions and large monsters hit by the blade.",
      "summary_zh": "德莱厄斯蓄力然后将他的斧头挥舞成一个大圈。被斧刃击中的敌人会比被斧柄击中的敌人受到更多伤害。德莱厄斯会基于被斧刃击中的敌方英雄或大型野怪的数量来获得治疗效果。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307013:4007591"
      ]
    },
