      "summary_en": "Darius hones his axe, passively causing his physical damage to ignore a percentage of his target's Armor. When activated, Darius sweeps up his enemies with his axe's hook and pulls them to him.",
      "summary_zh": "德莱厄斯磨利他的巨斧，被动地让他的物理伤害无视目标一部分护甲。在主动施放时，德莱厄斯会用斧头上的钩子横扫他的敌人，并将他们拉到德莱厄斯身边。",
