      "summary_en": "Darius leaps to an enemy champion and strikes a lethal blow, dealing true damage. This damage is increased for each stack of Hemorrhage on the target. If Noxian Guillotine is a killing blow, its cooldown is refreshed for a brief duration.",
      "summary_zh": "德莱厄斯跃向目标英雄并进行致命打击，造成真实伤害。目标身上的每层出血效果都会提升这个技能的伤害。如果诺克萨斯断头台完成了一次击杀，那么它的冷却时间会暂时被重置。",
